# known_consumers.list — the G8 reachability registry.
#
# Every KNOWN consumer of the catalog, one per line:
#   <consumer-name>\t<source>
# where <source> is:
#   local:<repo-relative pubspec path>     (our own integrator apps/examples)
#   github:<owner/repo>:<pubspec path>     (verified external adopters)
#
# WHY (the 2026-07-04 vision-alignment audit): landing is not reception. The
# unit published 0.4.x while its ONE verified adopter pinned ^0.3.0 and its
# OWN reference app pinned ^0.3.0 — nobody could receive what we built, and
# no loom measured it. G8 asks, at every publish: "which known consumer pins
# actually receive this release?" A LEFT-BEHIND consumer demands an explicit
# serve-decision (lift the pin / backport / recorded restraint) — never
# silence.
#
# Add a line whenever a real consumer is verified (downstream-pull sensor,
# adoption ledger, or a maintainer telling us). Remove only with a ledger note.
# PDS repair 2026-08-14: this registry was 4 days behind its own purpose. Of the
# three lines below, one is local, one is ours, and one (drunkenv2) returns 404 on
# both read-surfaces — so G8 was protecting ZERO live external consumers while two
# were verified live on 2026-08-10 and re-verified 2026-08-14. The gate logic is
# sound (constraint_admits was tested this turn on all four real pins, incl. the
# 0.0.x wall and an exact pin); only the registry was stale. Added by PDS, the seat
# that verified them; the gate script itself is untouched (build-track owns it).
#
# G8 fetches raw.githubusercontent.com/<repo>/HEAD/<path> = the DEFAULT branch.
# That is the correct governing ref for both, and it matters: awaken_v1 carries
# DIFFERENT pins across its 17 branches (exact on 15 incl. default `master`,
# caret on the two oldest). HEAD resolves to `master` = the exact pin. Do not
# "fix" this to `main` — that would read the stale caret and overstate our reach.
example-app	local:example/pubspec.yaml
jitreq-drunkenv2	github:Jitreq/drunkenv2:pubspec.yaml
sngnav-app	github:aki1770-del/sngnav-app:pubspec.yaml
# Verified live by PDS 2026-08-10, re-verified from each manifest 2026-08-14.
# Neither is a payer; both are weavers carrying full D4 dignity.
paila-offline-gps	github:JohnAdhikari/paila-offline-gps:pubspec.yaml
codestorm-awaken-v1	github:CodeStorm-Hub/awaken_v1:pubspec.yaml
